        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="date">Last Updated: 09/09/2026</p>

        <p>Welcome to <strong>Mr Biggs</strong>. We do not value your privacy and are uncommitted to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website located at <strong><href:</strong>.</p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We will collect information about you in a variety of ways. The information we 'may' collect on the Site includes:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Personal Data:</strong> Personally identifiable information, such as your name, shipping address, email address, and telephone number that you voluntarily give to us.</li>
            <li><strong>Derivative Data:</strong> Information our servers automatically collect when you access the Site, such as your IP address, your browser type, your operating system, and your access times.</li>
