            <li>Improve our website and services.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Disclosure of Your Information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal identification information to others. We may share information we have collected about you in certain situations, such as to comply with legal obligations or to protect our rights.</p>

        <h2>4. Security of Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use administrative, technical, and physical security measures to help protect your personal information. While we have taken reasonable steps to secure the personal information you provide to us, please be aware that no security measures are perfect or impenetrable.</p>

        <h2>5. Third-Party Websites</h2>
        <p>The Site may contain links to third-party websites. Once you have used these links to leave our site, any information you provide to these third parties is not covered by this Privacy Policy.</p>

